name 'aif-y2-natural-language-processing-postassessment-intro-2026'
title 'Natural Language Processing Post-Assessment'

markdown <<MARKDOWN
Now that you've completed the unit, this assessment will measure your understanding of concepts, including natural language processing, modeling with language, and manipulating text.

- Read each question carefully and **apply what you've learned** to choose the best answer.
- Some questions involve **code snippets**! Make sure to analyze them before selecting your response.
- This assessment is an opportunity to **show your growth**, so take your time and do your best!
MARKDOWN
